{
  "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Military installation/Lab table (d6)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,22,59]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,59,61]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Experimental weapon site. Roll on the Lab Horror table. 2 in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,61,122]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6 chance of finding a random weapon (roll twice and choose\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,122,181]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the best result).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,181,199]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,199,201]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "A respiratory toxin was released here. Save vs. L4 Poison. Roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,201,265]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "at +1 if you have the Resilient Skill, +2 if you have Resilient\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,265,329]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "(Expert) or lose 2 Life. If you are wearing a gas mask, you are\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,329,393]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "immune to this damage.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,393,416]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,416,418]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You find computer printouts about mutants. If you spend\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,418,474]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "2XP studying them, you gain the Mutant Hunter Arcane Skill.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,474,534]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may study the papers right here or, if you do not have the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,534,597]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "XP right now, carry them with you (they count as a carried\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,597,656]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "object) and study them later. You may roll a 2 in 6 chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,656,718]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "finding a random weapon here, but if you do so, you must also\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,718,780]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll a 2 in 6 chance of an encounter from the Lab Horror table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,780,844]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "4\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,844,846]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Here a crate containing  d3 grenades on a bandolier is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,846,901]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "guarded by 2d6 L2 zombies, Slow Undead, damage 1, 1 Life\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,901,958]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "point each. You may take the grenades if you destroy all\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,958,1015]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "zombies. You may choose to ignore the encounter and run\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1015,1071]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "away. The zombies (and the grenades) remain in the area if\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1071,1130]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "you leave.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1130,1141]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "5\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1141,1143]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "This was a military lab. You find a single hypodermic needle\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1143,1204]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "containing a  fluorescent fluid . You can keep it in your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1204,1262]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "inventory (as an item of negligible weight) or inject it (go to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1262,1326]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Event #4 if you do so). This is a unique event. Reroll if you get\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1326,1392]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "this again.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1392,1404]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1404,1406]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "As you step into the installation, there is an explosion. Save\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1406,1469]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "vs. L4 explosion, at +1 if you have Danger Sense and/or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1469,1525]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Agile, or lose 2 Life. There is a 2 in 6 chance that the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1525,1582]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "explosion attracts d3 L2 Zombies (Slow Undead) that will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1582,1639]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-military-installation-lab-table:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "attack you.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[47,1639,1650]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    47
  ]
}
